{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1409907-how-high-level-do-your-games-get","id":1409907,"title":"How high level do your games get?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-23T07:54:51-07:00","id":1409907,"title":"How high level do your games get?","content":"I get the impression from reading this forum that while vampire games often last long enough for players to pile up 30 plus discipline dots and maybe diablerize their way up a few generations, that Mage characters mastering anywhere near that many spheres are rare. <br /> <br /> Now I realize that XP costs are higher in mage, but it seems that that is not the whole story to me. <br /> <br /> Is my impression correct in your guys experience? Do most of your games remain gritty street level afairs or do you end up as masters slinging around epic level spells?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2078,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","user":"Alucard","date":".  Grammar 08-23-2020, 10:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T20:42:50-07:00","id":1410004,"title":"","content":"Modern The Lord of the Rings","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T21:09:34-07:00","id":1410007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rock113</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1409907-how-high-level-do-your-games-get?p=1410004#post1410004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Modern The Lord of the Rings</div> </div> </div> </div>This is very vague. <br /> <br /> If you're talking on screen feats by Gandalf for example it's not high.<br /> <br /> But Gandalf is actually a Maiar, an incredibly powerful spirit equivalent to an Incarna. <br /> <br /> So, do you mean weak? Powerful? Powerful but acting subtly because of paradox?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T05:14:29-07:00","id":1410040,"title":"","content":"In our Round containing out of two orphans that have already an ancient mage as master, an akasheyja that is the reincarnation of Komatsuhime and later came in an Orphanmage that is a GoG Kinfolk and still deciding if he want to join the Chakravanti or the Kha'vadi.<br /> In the Game we already have at least one 3 Sphere and a 5 Sphere in their gifted Sphere except me. The 3 Sphere is by everyone except one Life that whas bought in the start.<br /> We plan at least to get two 5 Spheres per Character, mayby three before we stop.<br /> But we started with slight more power having something like twice as much background freebies. But we have weaknesses in comparison too. My character for example should not exist like this but should be Marauder unaware that he is using magic nor that there is any wonder. So the Master saw this future, changed it with preventing the death of the person whose death makes his life hell. But the Paradox for breaking this fate manifested in that he has more &quot;flashbacks&quot; from the life as a weak willed ptsd ridden he should lead instead of being a wonderwirker that makes the life better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T21:32:21-07:00","id":1410607,"title":"","content":"My games never went past Arete 3 with 10 or so dots in spheres.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T10:14:16-07:00","id":1411088,"title":"","content":"My current game has been going on since 2012 (wow, has it been that long?). The two original players both reached Arete 5 at some point over a year ago. I brought in a couple new players for their first White Wolf experience last year. Both made terrific characters and started at Arete 4. One is currently going through his Seeking; the other plans to as soon as possible. This is by far the highest power chronicle I've run (Arete 4 was the usual peak in previous games), but interestingly the PC's don't throw around mighty magics all that often. Paradox is still frightening, especially to the veterans who know how much I love playing with it. But with the world on the brink, with a multitude of threats that could change the world or end it, great workings are coming to the fore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12765-otto-d-fey","name":"Otto D'Fey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T20:13:12-07:00","id":1411155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Otto D'Fey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1409907-how-high-level-do-your-games-get?p=1411088#post1411088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My current game has been going on since 2012 (wow, has it been that long?). The two original players both reached Arete 5 at some point over a year ago. I brought in a couple new players for their first White Wolf experience last year. Both made terrific characters and started at Arete 4. One is currently going through his Seeking; the other plans to as soon as possible. This is by far the highest power chronicle I've run (Arete 4 was the usual peak in previous games), but interestingly the PC's don't throw around mighty magics all that often. Paradox is still frightening, especially to the veterans who know how much I love playing with it. But with the world on the brink, with a multitude of threats that could change the world or end it, great workings are coming to the fore.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eight years? Wow. If you have guys have playing with any regularity they must have a ton of spheres to work with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}